+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Fused in-graph all-reduce for CPU NUMA devices.
+//
+// Instead of returning to the main thread at every tensor-parallel boundary (one dispatch
+// round trip + an OpenMP region start per subgraph, ~157-400 times per token), each device
+// runs the whole token as ONE graph. A custom op is inserted at every boundary: all devices
+// spin-synchronize, each device sums its slice of the F32 partial across the four device
+// buffers and writes the result into all of them, then they synchronize again.
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
